description:
What will you do?
Analyze, develop, and optimize internal applications or projects for clients;
Define and provide details for testing and authorization concepts, cooperating with application architects;
Evaluate, select, and define appropriate implementation versions based on programming requirements;
Collaborate with team members to ensure integration and meet deadlines;
Stay up to date with the latest technologies and identify new optimization solutions.
What are we offering?
Competitive salary;
Meal tickets;
Performance bonuses;
Training sessions to support your professional development;
The possibility to work from home;
A friendly and motivating work environment.
Represents An Advantage
Experience in developing applications using relational databases (Oracle, SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL);
Programming experience using Spring MVC;
Linux usage knowledge.
What are we looking for?
Experience in Java Web programming (JSP, servlets, XML, and HTML);
Experience with HTML5/CSS3;
Experience with client-side technologies: JavaScript, jQuery, and HTML;
Experience in developing web services such as REST and SOAP/XML;
Knowledge of development environments like Eclipse or NetBeans;
Flexibility, good communication skills, and being a team player;
Initiative, analytical thinking, and attention to detail.
Apply for this job!
